Prepare the weekly affiliate-program scorecard using only sourced data. State
the reporting window, source, and last-updated time. Cover prospects sourced,
qualified, contacted, replied, approved, onboarded, activated, active, dormant,
and reactivated; clicks, qualified leads, conversions, partner-sourced revenue,
conversion rate, attribution exceptions, reversals, and payout exceptions.
Explain the largest movement, identify missing or conflicting data, and propose
one measurable experiment. Do not change attribution, commissions, payouts,
terms, or external systems.
